      "source": "Sets the filter query for a nested sort.<br/>\nNote: This cannot be a <a href=\"CriteriaQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>CriteriaQuery</code></a>, as that would be sent as a nested query within the filter, use a\n<a href=\"../../client/elc/NativeQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.client.elc\"><code>NativeQuery</code></a> or <a href=\"StringQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>StringQuery</code></a> instead.",
      "translation": "设置嵌套排序的过滤查询。<br/>\n注意：这不能是<a href=\"CriteriaQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>CriteriaQuery</code></a>，因为那样会作为过滤器内的嵌套查询发送，请使用<a href=\"../../client/elc/NativeQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.client.elc\"><code>NativeQuery</code></a>或<a href=\"StringQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>StringQuery</code></a>代替。",
